m{Lang}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}language}\\vdash \\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal L=\\langle S,\\alpha,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\land S\\cap\\mathrm{Var}_{93}=\\varnothing\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}language}\\vdash \\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal L=\\langle S,\\alpha,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\land S\\cap\\mathrm{Var}_{93}=\\varnothing\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\pi_1(\\mathcal L),\\pi_2(\\mathcal L)\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\pi_1(\\mathcal L),\\pi_2(\\mathcal L)\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The components <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> are bound inside the definition. The projection <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> gives downstream algebras an explicit type determined by the language object.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"re